Normalization has not been done yet, in fact, I don't think any normalization occurs on `TarWriter.WriteEntry`. @carlossanlop?

```cs
[Fact]
public void qt()
{
    string name = "foo\\bar\\baz";
    TarEntry entry = new UstarTarEntry(TarEntryType.RegularFile, name);

    MemoryStream ms = new();
    TarWriter writer = new(ms, leaveOpen: true);
    writer.WriteEntry(entry);
    writer.Dispose();

    ms.Position = 0;
    using TarReader reader = new(ms);
    entry = reader.GetNextEntry();

    Console.WriteLine(entry.Name); // prints "foo\bar\baz".
    reader.Dispose();
}
```

